From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: office <office@localhost>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 15:52:10 +0500
Subject: [PATCH 100/102] ui-egui, engine, app: office overlay hook (name,
 icon, version, attribution)

Adds a build-script/overlay module pair (build_office.rs, office_overlay.rs) that renders
OFFICE_OVERLAY_DIR/overlay.env into constants, and routes the app name, window title,
window icon, About heading/attribution, print-preview title and the product version
through it. i18n::tr/tr_ctx/tr_id/menu_label pass their result through rebrand(), so
every catalog string shows the overlay's name. Without OFFICE_OVERLAY_DIR every value
is upstream's own.
